  "name": "Blastback",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/fire/explosion-fireball-large-orange.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 14th level, your aim has gotten good enough that you can send enemies flying with your cannon.</p>\n<p>Once per turn, while raging and when you hit a creature with a weapon attack using a weapon with the heavy property, you can force the creature to make a Strength saving throw. The DC for the saving throw is calculated as 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength modifier. On a failed save, a creature is pushed up to 15 feet away from you and takes additional damage equal to half your Barbarian level (rounded down).</p>",
